# route: level=w2_l2_coop difficulty=expert players=2 ends=exit after=level:w2_l2b_coop expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:3,painting:23
# w2_l2_coop Expert two-stream route: "Bone Gorge" for two (designer DB2; ticks:P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S; recorded from closed-loop duo bots,
# build/db2/bot_w2_l2_coop.gd). Gate 'seesaw': P1 springs off the glowing cap onto the bone shelf and drops on the
# see-saw's high end, P2 is launched up the bone wall and clubs the coiled vine down; P1 hops off P2's head onto
# the x2 bone ledge (painting 23); gate 'lift': P1 holds the plate while P2 rides the lift pillar up and clubs the
# second vine down; a Shellback pincer on the terrace, a glider each over the gorge, a Shellback pincer at the far
# rim, and both crouch side by side in the exit tunnel: the Brace Wall stops the Bull Rex.
# Re-recorded by enemies-A (wf10) for G57 (one hit per strike in co-op files: a swing hurts a given enemy once,
# so a 25-hp enemy takes two strikes) with the same closed-loop bot (build/enemies_a10/bot_w2_l2_coop_ea.gd: in a Shellback pincer the
# striker strikes its back until it is dead, up to 8 strikes instead of 3).
# Re-recorded in wf11 (levels) with the same bot (build/enemies_a10/bot_w2_l2_coop_ea.gd) on the rebuilt file: a
# stalactite roofs the cap and the bone shelf, the lift's foot is clean (its three spots stand on the terrace).
